sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Active member
    participant UI as Leave UI (proposed)
    participant API as Leave API (proposed)
    participant S as Leave service (proposed)
    participant DB as ORM / PostgreSQL
    Note over UI,DB: US4 proposed - Host, started/cancelled and repeat-response policies await decision
    U->>UI: Click Leave
    UI-->>U: Confirmation dialog
    alt Cancel dialog
        UI-->>U: Keep membership, no API call
    else Confirm
        UI->>UI: Disable submit while pending
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/parties/{id}/leave + empty JSON + session/CSRF
        alt Invalid session / CSRF / client-selected actor
            API-->>UI: Error, no mutation
        else Valid request
            API->>S: Leave with actor from session
            S->>DB: BEGIN, lock Party then own membership
            DB-->>S: Party and membership/history
            S->>S: Recheck current time, membership and confirmed policy
            alt Missing / forbidden / Host or state prohibited by policy
                S->>DB: ROLLBACK
                S-->>API: Error per contract
                API-->>UI: Explain refusal, re-enable button
            else Already left
                S->>DB: End transaction without another write
                S-->>API: Repeat result per agreed contract
                API-->>UI: Do not return a seat twice
            else Active member allowed to leave
                S->>DB: Set left_at, retain history
                alt Write fails
                    S->>DB: ROLLBACK
                    S-->>API: Failure
                    API-->>UI: Error, no success state
                else Write succeeds
                    S->>DB: COMMIT
                    S-->>API: Leave success
                    API-->>UI: Success per contract
                    UI->>API: Refresh members and Party Detail
                    API->>DB: Count active members, slots = capacity - count
                    DB-->>API: Current data
                    API-->>UI: Updated members/count/slots
                    UI-->>U: Show confirmed result
                end
            end
        end
    end
    Note over S,DB: Concurrent leave/approve/edit must share Party-first lock order, verify with DB integration tests
